Protect audit records from ordinary administrator editing where possible.

Clearly distinguish an application audit record from a guaranteed, tamper-proof database audit log.

## 21. PERFORMANCE AND RESOURCE MANAGEMENT

Use:
- PostgreSQL connection pooling
- Bounded query execution
- Database statement timeouts
- Request timeouts appropriate to operation type
- Pagination
- Appropriate indexes
- Efficient JOINs and aggregations
